# Follow-up to 2026-09-30-2.play, same cell (mode=daily boss=crowns(label)
# spec=priest:shadow style=dodge view=1280x800 save=carried). That run found
# `key escape` (lowercase, exactly as docs/playtest.md's own command table
# writes it) throws driver-threw -- already known (direction.md, session
# 2026-09-26-10: Playwright wants "Escape" capitalized) so not new by
# itself. Redone here with the correct case to reach the thing that run
# never got to: whether the daily screen's "no attempt yet today" updates
# within *one* script/Page right after a real attempt finishes, which
# isolates a same-session display bug from #273's already-filed
# cross-invocation port/localStorage-origin bug (direction.md [[#5]]) --
# no prior session has checked this specific question.
open
tap daily
targets
shot before-attempt
tap class:6
tap start
waitscreen fight 15
state

play dodge 140
state
shot fight-end
bill

key Escape
targets
shot after-escape
